<title>USA: IPO FILING - Hyseq Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - Hyseq Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name			Hyseq Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			HYSQ.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $12-$14/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    2.75 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 2.75 million</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo    12,127,418</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter		 Lehman Brothers</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  412,500 shrs</p>
<p>Business: Based in Sunnyvale, Calif., Hyseq applies the proprietary DNA array technology of its integrated HgY genomics platform to develop gene-based therapeutic product candidates and diagnostic products and tests.</p>
<p>Use of Proceeds: for development of potential therapeutic product candidates and diagnositc tests, expansion of the HyGenomics Database, further development of the HyChip Module, investments in capital equipment and leasing of additional sapce to increase capacity and general corporate purposes, including working capital.</p>
</text>
